    - Reporting installed files as outdated merely because a newer version is published when they match the version the project runs. Equally wrong is a pinned project behind latest told nothing.
    - A version notice that floods the user with the full changelog or every entry of every skipped version. It is a short incentive to upgrade, not a release history.
